tract. It reduces the transfer of melanin to the skin, making skin fairer, smoother and softer.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply on wet face and neck, gently massage with circular movements, wash off with water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply on cleanse face, gently massage the gel. Avoid contact with eyes.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply on face and neck, Avoiding Eyes, let it dry Wash off with plain water.</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Cetostearyl Alcohol</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</li><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Polyethylene Scrub</li><li>Stearic Acid</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba) Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Methylparaben</li><li>Propylparaben</li><li>Allantoin</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Sweet Almond</li><li>(Prunus amygdalus</li><li>dulcis) Oil</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Cyclomethicone</li><li>Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Fruit Extract</li><li>Carrot Extract</li><li>Fenugreek (Ingonella foenumgraecum) Extract</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xyli