:</strong> Gold Pack : This Gold pack contains natural extract of Liquorice Extract, Mulberry extract, aloevera extract and other precious ingredients Gold Foil that lighten the skin and control production of melanin &amp; making skin fairer and lighten facial tone.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply this gel scrub lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes, Wash off with plain water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply this gel lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a generous amount of this pack on face and neck leaving eyes. Relax till completely dry. Rinse with plain water .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Propylene Glycol</li><li>Turmeric Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Scrub beads</li><li>Xylityglucoside</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba)</li><li>Extract</li><li>PEG 12 Dimethicone</li><li>Carbomer</li><li>Trethanolamine</li><li>Polysorbate 20</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Imidazolidinyl Urea</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>24K Gold flakes</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Butyrospermum Parki (Shea Butter)</li><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Ashwagandha (Withania Somnifera) Extract</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Cyclomethicone</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Fruit Extract</li><li>DMDM hydantoin</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Borax</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:77;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:151;s:4:"slug";s:34:"fruitmix-skin-whitening-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:34:"FRUITMIX SKIN WHITENING FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:58:"uploads/products/fruitmix-skin-whitening-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3631:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Fruit Mix Cleansing Cream : This cream contains of extract Papaya, lemon, Cucumber and Ananas Sativus which help in removing dead cells along with breaking down the inactive proteins. Thus, it leaves the skin super soft and radiant.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> – Fruit Mix Exfoliating Scrub : Enriched with the goodness of Pomegranate extract, Aloe Vera extract and Papaya extract, Cucumber extract, this formulation gently removes the dead cell of facial skin. It improves the skin complexion and lightens the patches.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> – Fruit Mix Massage Cream: This is a rich composition of Mulberry Extract, Papaya Extract, Ananas Sativus and Vitamin E. It improves the skin complexion and nourishes it with all necessary mineral and vitamins.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> – Fruit Mix Face Pack This formulation contains Sweet Almond Oil, Bearberry Leaf Extract, Aloe vera extract, Cucumber extract, this combination not only tighten the skin pores but removes blemishes, dark spot, evens skin tone and brings a glow to the skin .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply on the face and neck and massaged gently in circular motion for 5 minutes. Wash off with fresh water and pat dry.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply on the face and neck, massage gently in circular direction for 5-10 minutes. Wash with fresh water, pat dry .</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply all over the face and neck. Massage for 15-20 minutes in circular motion with firm upward and outward strokes. Massage until cream gets absorbed in the skin.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply a thick layer all over f ace and neck, leave it until gets dry. Rinse off with fresh water.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a few drops of this serum on your face and tap gently with your fingertips until gets absorbed .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Ananas Sativus (Pineapple) Fruit Extract</li><li>Cucumber (Cucumis Sativus) Extract</li><li>Lemon (Citrus medica limonum) Extract</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</li><li>Pomegranate (Punica granatum) Extract</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba) Extract</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Propylene Glycol</li><li>Liquorice (Glycymhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>PEG 12 Dimethicone</li><li>Carbomer</li><li>Triethanolamine</li><li>Polysorbate 20</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Pea (Pisum sativum) Extract</li><li>Imidazolidinyl Urea</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Fra